    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">El lun., 25 feb. 2019 a las 9:10, Karl Broman (&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kbr...@gmail.com</a>&gt;) escribió:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\"></div><div dir=\"ltr\">It is difficult to say anything without more information. What cofactors were chosen? </div><div dir=\"ltr\">What were the results without cofactors? What kind of cross? How many individuals? </div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">karl</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Feb 25, 2019, at 6:04 AM, Graciela Caruso &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">gbcar...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br><br></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Dear Karl<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">I have scaned QTLs in two chromosomes using MQM. I am not sure if I am\r\ncorrect undersanding the results. I have obtained high LOD score values using\r\nmqmscan. The problem is that when I run the function including cofactors\r\n(mqmautocofactors), the output shows low LODs. <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">mqm&lt;-mqmscan(misdatosaug, cofactors=NULL,pheno.col=2,\r\nmodel=c(&quot;additive&quot;,&quot;dominance&quot;), forceML=F, em.iter=1000,\r\nwindow.size=10, step.size=5) <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">autocofactors &lt;- mqmautocofactors(misdatosaug, num=7, distance=10,\r\ndominance=T)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">mqm_auto &lt;- mqmscan(misdatosaug, autocofactors)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:150%;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">mqm_auto::<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"975\" style=\"width:585pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0cm 0cm 6pt 4.5pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;line-height:normal;w